{
  "machine": "sce:std/shared/record_list",
  "about": "A change to the standard shared record list (sce:std/shared/record_list.scxml) is one unit and one message (docs/adr/0046, docs/adr/0085, section 1): a person stages the commands of a change with `more`, and the command that ends it closes it, when the change is judged whole, stamped once, taken in at once, and sent as one `record_list.change`: its author, its stamp, which is the dot of every write in it (a write carries 0 for a dot of its own), and its operations, every write-over before every write. A change one of whose commands is refused is refused whole. A peer's change reaches the copy as the same one message, is taken in whole, and moves the clock once by its stamp. Expected values come from a model of the list, not from a backend.",
  "steps": [
    {"note": "started: a copy that holds nothing", "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "0", "values": []}}},
    {"note": "the host names the copy, node 1", "event": "record_list.join", "data": {"node": "1"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "1"}}},
    {"note": "the first command of a change says it goes on: it is held, and nothing is stamped, sent or taken in", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "now": "1727000100000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [], "clock": {"wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}}}},
    {"note": "so is the second", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 2, "value": "3", "text": "", "now": "1727000100000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [], "clock": {"wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}}}},
    {"note": "the third ends the change: three fields of one row taken in at one stamp, and sent as one change of three writes, whose dot is the change's", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "now": "1727000100000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#people", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 2, "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change that writes one field over and gives the row a fourth begins", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "now": "1727000101000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "and ends: the value it saw written over, then both writes, one change", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "9", "text": "", "now": "1727000101000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#people", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 1, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "adds": [{"element": "327682", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327683", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327684", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change begins on another row", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "ok", "now": "1727000102000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "its second command carries a text one byte past what a person writes: the change is refused whole, its first field with it", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 2, "value": "0", "text": "a note that is one byte past it!!", "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 1}}},
    {"note": "a change that names one register twice begins", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "a", "now": "1727000102000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "and is refused whole when it ends: the order of its commands means nothing", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "b", "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 1}}},
    {"note": "another person's change of two fields arrives as one message: both are taken in together, and the clock is moved once by its stamp", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "2", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 7, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 7, "field": 2, "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change of his that writes over the fourth field and writes it anew: the value is replaced at once, never empty between the two", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "2", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "ops": [{"kind": 1, "id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "0", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "adds": [{"element": "327682", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327683", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "458753", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"element": "458754", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"element": "327684", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 1, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a third person's change made at the same instant as his, with a counter past his: the clock takes the larger counter and moves past it", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "3", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 4, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 10, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}, {"kind": 0, "id": 10, "field": 2, "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 4, "nodeId": "3"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 4, "nodeId": "3"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 5, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "the copy's own change after them is stamped after everything it has taken in", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 10, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "three", "now": "1727000104000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#people", "event": "record_list.change", "data": {"by": "1", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 6, "ops": [{"kind": 0, "id": 10, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "three", "wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}]}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 4, "nodeId": "3"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 4, "nodeId": "3"}, {"id": "10", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "three", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 6, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 6, "nodeId": "1"}}}}
  ]
}
